sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Coordinator
    participant Memtable
    participant CommitLog
    participant SSTable
    participant Compaction
    
    Client->>Coordinator: WRITE request
    
    par Write to Commit Log
        Coordinator->>CommitLog: Append entry
        CommitLog-->>Coordinator: Durable
    and Write to Memtable
        Coordinator->>Memtable: Insert data
        Memtable-->>Coordinator: Complete
    end
    
    Coordinator-->>Client: ACK
    
    Note over Memtable: Memtable fills up
    
    Memtable->>SSTable: Flush to disk
    Note over SSTable: Immutable sorted file
    
    loop Background Process
        Compaction->>SSTable: Merge multiple SSTables
        SSTable-->>Compaction: New compacted SSTable
    end
    
    Note over CommitLog: Segments cleaned<br/>after memtable flush
```

**Write Path:**
1. Commit Log: Durability (sequential write)
2. Memtable: In-memory buffer (sorted structure)
3. SSTable: Persistent storage (immutable)
4. Compaction: Merge and cleanup (background)